invalid type: string "Prompt: How does processing-role=\"resource-only\" work in a full map with keydefs and reusable topics?\n\nAnswer:\nIn a full map, `processing-role='resource-only'` is commonly used on branches that provide keys or reusable targets but should not publish as normal navigation topics.\n\nExample\n```xml\n<map>\n  <title>Product guide</title>\n  <topicref href='intro.dita'/>\nÿÿ